OL,3,GNEWSACastle to light up again after
OL,4,A15-year absence
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 17th Century castle which sits on a
OL,7,Fprominent ridge is set to be lit up
OL,8,Fyear round after new floodlighting was
OL,9,Finstalled.
OL,11,FBolsover Castle, high above the Vale of
OL,12,FScarsdale in Derbyshire, will be
OL,13,Filluminated after dark each night from
OL,14,FThursday, when the official switch-on
OL,15,Ftakes place.
OL,17,FThe return of permanent lighting at the
OL,18,Flandmark after a 15-year absence has
OL,19,Fbeen made possible through #10,000
OL,20,Ffunding from Bolsover District
OL,21,FCouncil's community and place grant
OL,22,Fprogramme, said English Heritage.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
