OL,3,GNEWSACastle to light up again after
OL,4,A15-year absence
OL,5,
OL,6,FCastle manager Joel Wileman said the
OL,7,Fproject gives "locals and visitors
OL,8,Fanother way to appreciate this
OL,9,Fremarkable part of the town's
OL,10,Fheritage".
